---
import { SITE, url, sectors } from '../lib/site';
---
<footer class="theme-dark pb-24 md:pb-0">
  <div class="wrap pt-24 pb-16">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <img src={url('brand/logo-dark.svg')} alt="Orbital Aerial Solutions" width="96" height="67" class="h-14 w-auto" loading="lazy" />
        <p class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-sm leading-snug">Aerial intelligence for operations where precision matters.</p>
        <p class="mt-5 text-fg-2 text-[15px]">Austin, TX · <a class="underline-offset-4 hover:underline text-white" href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4">Industrial</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-fg-2 text-[15px]">
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('industrial/#services')}>Stockpile measurement</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('industrial/#services')}>Site progress & digital twins</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('industrial/#services')}>Asset documentation</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('industrial/#credentials')}>Credentials</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4">Real Estate</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-fg-2 text-[15px]">
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('real-estate/#packages')}>Aerial packages · from $230</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('real-estate/#packages')}>Ground packages · from $150</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('real-estate/#work')}>Recent work</a></li>
          <li><a class="hover:text-white" href={url('real-estate/#coverage')}>Coverage area</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-4">Sectors</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-fg-2 text-[15px]">{sectors.map((s) => <li>{s}</li>)}</ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-white/10 text-[13px] text-fg-3 leading-relaxed max-w-4xl">
      <p><strong class="text-fg-2 font-semibold">Image credits.</strong> Hero video and industrial site photos are licensed stock from <a class="underline hover:text-white" href="https://www.pexels.com/license/">Pexels</a> (free to use) and show the type of site, not Orbital client work: <a class="underline hover:text-white" href="https://www.pexels.com/video/aerial-view-of-industrial-gravel-quarry-30911567/">gravel quarry video</a>, <a class="underline hover:text-white" href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/aerial-view-of-quarry-with-heavy-machinery-33122147/">quarry</a>, <a class="underline hover:text-white" href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/aerial-view-of-construction-site-in-quebec-city-32211979/">construction site</a>, <a class="underline hover:text-white" href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/aerial-view-of-industrial-storage-facility-33369529/">storage facility</a>. Sample terrain, point cloud and surface model: USGS 3DEP elevation and National Map orthoimagery (public domain). Real estate photos: Orbital Aerial Solutions. Product screens are illustrative mockups with sample values.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10">
    <div class="wrap py-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-between text-sm text-fg-3">
      <p>© 2026 Orbital Aerial Solutions. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>Made by Mohammad Youssef</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
